---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { brand } from '../config/brand';
---
<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | Belvedere Decks"
  description="How Belvedere Decks handles your information: what we collect when you book an estimate, how we use it, and what we never do with it."
  noindex={true}
>
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <p class="eyebrow">Privacy policy</p>
      <h1>Your information, handled like our own.</h1>
      <div class="rule"></div>
      <p class="lead">
        Effective August 3, 2026. This is written in plain English on purpose. If any
        of it is unclear, email us and a person will answer.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container">
      <h2>What we collect</h2>
      <p>
        When you book an estimate or contact us, we collect what you give us: your name,
        phone number, email, project address, and what you tell us about your deck. When
        you browse the site, we use Google Analytics to see which pages get read and
        where visitors come from; that data is aggregated and does not identify you by
        name.
      </p>

      <h2>What we use it for</h2>
      <p>
        Scheduling and preparing for your visit, preparing your estimate, and running
        the project if you hire us. Your booking is stored in our scheduling database,
        your appointment is placed on our business calendar (Microsoft 365), and your
        confirmation email is delivered through our email provider. Each of those
        vendors processes your information only to provide that service to us.
      </p>

      <h2>What we never do</h2>
      <p>
        We do not sell your information. We do not share it with marketers. We do not
        add you to a mailing list because you asked for an estimate. If you tell us no,
        the conversation ends there. No drip campaigns.
      </p>

      <h2>Cookies and analytics</h2>
      <p>
        The site uses Google Analytics cookies to measure traffic and to tell us when a
        booking came from an ad, so we know which advertising is worth paying for. You
        can block cookies in your browser and every part of this site, including
        booking, still works.
      </p>

      <h2>Your choices</h2>
      <p>
        Want to know what we have about you, correct it, or have it deleted? Email
        <a href={`mailto:${brand.email}`}> {brand.email}</a> and we will handle it,
        subject to records we are legally required to keep, like contracts and
        transaction history.
      </p>

      <p>
        {brand.legalName}, Maryland. Questions:
        <a href={`mailto:${brand.email}`}> {brand.email}</a>.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
